  "text": "Our study found that only 56.6% of non-medical female university students in Riyadh City, Saudi Arabia, demonstrated adequate knowledge of CKD risk factors, which is higher than a previous Saudi study [12] where only 31.6% of participants had moderate to high knowledge. This difference may be attributed to our sample consisting solely of university students, while their [12] sample included students, employed, and unemployed individuals, some of whom had only completed primary school."
